# Persian range "from" lead -- opens the bounded interval "از ... تا ...".
#   "از": Dehkhoda Dictionary and Sokhan Comprehensive Dictionary, s.v. "از"
#   (حرف اضافه) -- مبدأ و نقطهٔ آغاز در زمان و مکان; correlative of "تا" for the
#   term, as in "از ۵ ژوئن تا ۱۲ ژوئن". It is also the "since" marker
#   (marker_since), which is the open reading of the same starting point.
از
